<title>GERMANY: WestLB 96 net profit up 10 pct.</title>
<headline>WestLB 96 net profit up 10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			    736     vs 667</p>
<p>    Group oper profit after provisions    1,389   vs 1,256</p>
<p>    Group oper profit before provisions   1,896   vs 1,829</p>
<p>    Group net interest income		 3,934   vs 3,813</p>
<p>    Group net commission income	     1,652   vs 1,392</p>
<p>    Group own-account trade profit	  458     vs 288</p>
<p>    Group personnel costs		     2,518   vs 2,232</p>
<p>    Group balance sheet total		 470,789 vs 428,622</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German bank is Westdeutsche Landesbank Girozentrale (WESTLB), Germany's largest publicly-owned regional bank.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
